imbridge Send Later (macOS 15+): send-later {chatGuid, message, deliverAt (Unix seconds)} schedules a message with the
factory made for it (instantMessageWithText:...scheduledDate:), after checking the chat supports Send Later: a chat
that doesn't sends at once. cancel-scheduled {chatGuid, messageGuid} pages the message in and retracts its parts from
the message's own chat item, as Messages' Cancel does (cancelScheduledMessageItem:cancelType: returns quietly and
leaves it scheduled). Both validate input and catch exceptions.

